<div class="hero">
<div class="hero-icon">✈️</div>
<h1>
基于 LSTM 的航空发动机剩余寿命预测研究
<span class="en">LSTM-based Aero-engine Remaining Useful Life Prediction</span>
</h1>
<p>
第一主持人 · 国豪论坛学术汇报
<span class="en">Lead Researcher · Guohao Forum Academic Presentation</span>
</p>
</div>

<section class="card">
<h2>
项目概述
<span class="en">Project Overview</span>
</h2>
<p>
本项目使用长短期记忆网络（LSTM）对航空发动机的剩余使用寿命（Remaining Useful Life, RUL）进行预测。基于 NASA C-MAPSS 涡扇发动机退化仿真数据集，对比了多种 LSTM 架构的性能，并进行了数据清洗、特征工程、模型优化和鲁棒性分析。
<span class="en">This project uses Long Short-Term Memory (LSTM) networks to predict the Remaining Useful Life (RUL) of aero-engines. Based on the NASA C-MAPSS turbofan engine degradation simulation dataset, it compares the performance of multiple LSTM architectures and conducts data cleaning, feature engineering, model optimization and robustness analysis.</span>
</p>
</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>
数据集
<span class="en">Dataset</span>
</h2>
<p>
使用 NASA C-MAPSS 数据集，包含 4 个子集：
<span class="en">Using the NASA C-MAPSS dataset, containing 4 subsets:</span>
</p>
<div class="table-wrapper">
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>子集 <span class="en">Subset</span></th><th>发动机数量 <span class="en"># Engines</span></th><th>工况模式 <span class="en">Operating Modes</span></th><th>故障模式 <span class="en">Fault Mode</span></th><th>训练集 <span class="en">Train</span></th><th>测试集 <span class="en">Test</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>FD001</td><td>100</td><td>1种</td><td>1种 (HPC)</td><td>100</td><td>100</td></tr>
<tr><td>FD002</td><td>260</td><td>6种</td><td>1种 (HPC)</td><td>260</td><td>260</td></tr>
<tr><td>FD003</td><td>100</td><td>1种</td><td>2种 (HPC+Fan)</td><td>100</td><td>100</td></tr>
<tr><td>FD004</td><td>248</td><td>6种</td><td>2种 (HPC+Fan)</td><td>248</td><td>248</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>
方法论
<span class="en">Methodology</span>
</h2>

<h3 class="sub">
数据预处理
<span class="en">Data Preprocessing</span>
</h3>
<ul>
<li>
异常值检测：基于 IQR 方法识别并处理传感器异常值
<span class="en">Outlier detection: IQR-based method to identify and handle sensor anomalies</span>
</li>
<li>
数据平滑：采用滑动窗口平均减少噪声
<span class="en">Data smoothing: sliding window average to reduce noise</span>
</li>
<li>
特征工程：计算传感器相关性，筛选关键特征
<span class="en">Feature engineering: compute sensor correlation, select key features</span>
</li>
<li>
RUL 标签生成：采用分段线性退化模型（piecewise linear degradation）
<span class="en">RUL label generation: piecewise linear degradation model</span>
</li>
</ul>

<h3 class="sub">
模型架构对比
<span class="en">Model Architecture Comparison</span>
</h3>
<p>
对比了以下 6 种 LSTM 架构：
<span class="en">Compared the following 6 LSTM architectures:</span>
</p>
<div class="model-grid">
<div class="model-card">
<h4>单向 LSTM</h4>
<p>标准单向 LSTM 层 <span class="en">Standard unidirectional LSTM layer</span></p>
</div>
<div class="model-card">
<h4>单向 LSTM + Dropout</h4>
<p>单向 LSTM + Dropout 正则化 <span class="en">Unidirectional LSTM + Dropout regularization</span></p>
</div>
<div class="model-card">
<h4>双向 LSTM</h4>
<p>Bidirectional LSTM <span class="en">Bidirectional LSTM</span></p>
</div>
<div class="model-card">
<h4>双向 LSTM + Dropout</h4>
<p>双向 LSTM + Dropout <span class="en">Bidirectional LSTM + Dropout</span></p>
</div>
<div class="model-card">
<h4>LSTM-2</h4>
<p>双层 LSTM 架构 <span class="en">2-layer LSTM architecture</span></p>
</div>
<div class="model-card highlight">
<h4>改进的 LSTM ⭐</h4>
<p>优化结构（注意力机制 + 多层融合） <span class="en">Optimized structure (attention + multi-layer fusion)</span></p>
</div>
</div>

<h3 class="sub">
评估指标
<span class="en">Evaluation Metrics</span>
</h3>
<div class="metrics">
<span>MSE</span><span>RMSE</span><span>MAE</span><span>R²</span><span>S-score</span>
</div>
</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>
实验结果
<span class="en">Experimental Results</span>
</h2>

<h3 class="sub">
各数据集 LSTM-2 模型性能
<span class="en">LSTM-2 Model Performance by Dataset</span>
</h3>
<div class="table-wrapper">
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>数据集 <span class="en">Dataset</span></th><th>MSE</th><th>RMSE</th><th>MAE</th><th>R²</th><th>S-score</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>FD001</td><td>285.36</td><td>16.89</td><td>13.60</td><td>0.829</td><td>13369</td></tr>
<tr><td>FD002</td><td>337.34</td><td>18.37</td><td>14.66</td><td>0.791</td><td>51027</td></tr>
<tr><td>FD003</td><td>266.26</td><td>16.32</td><td>12.96</td><td>0.847</td><td>14757</td></tr>
<tr><td>FD004</td><td>447.71</td><td>21.16</td><td>16.60</td><td>0.739</td><td>95848</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>

<h3 class="sub">
FD001 改进模型 vs 基础模型
<span class="en">Improved vs Base Model on FD001</span>
</h3>
<div class="table-wrapper">
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>模型 <span class="en">Model</span></th><th>MSE</th><th>RMSE</th><th>MAE</th><th>R²</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>LSTM-2（基础）</td><td>285.36</td><td>16.89</td><td>13.60</td><td>0.829</td></tr>
<tr class="highlight-row"><td>改进的 LSTM</td><td>95.52</td><td>9.77</td><td>7.31</td><td><strong>0.943</strong></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p class="conclusion">
改进后的 LSTM 模型在 FD001 上 R² 从 0.829 提升至 0.943，RMSE 降低 42%。
<span class="en">The improved LSTM on FD001 increased R² from 0.829 to 0.943, with RMSE reduced by 42%.</span>
</p>
</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>
鲁棒性分析
<span class="en">Robustness Analysis</span>
</h2>
<ul>
<li>
特征重要性分析：评估各传感器特征对预测性能的贡献
