</li>
<li>
噪声敏感性测试：在不同噪声水平下验证模型稳定性
<span class="en">Noise sensitivity: validate model stability under different noise levels</span>
</li>
<li>
序列长度影响：分析输入序列长度对预测精度的影响
<span class="en">Sequence length impact: analyze input sequence length vs prediction accuracy</span>
</li>
</ul>
</section>

